    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AHTR Template Loader (one-time setup)\n\nStores the official SIRA AHTR PDF in the file_assets data table (base64, chunked) so the AHTR Assistant can fill the real form. Needed because SIRA's website blocks server-side downloads (Cloudflare challenge) — a human downloads the form once in a browser and drops it here.\n\nRe-run whenever SIRA updates the form: old chunks are cleared and replaced.",
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "115dc0cd-ddde-4328-a014-6dff0a2357d1",
